{"suttaId":"ne26","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Nett","vriCode":"s0519m.mul","paras":[713,715],"vripara":"69"},"segments":{"ne26:0.4":"Āvaṭṭahārasampāto","ne26:1.1":"Tattha katamo āvaṭṭo hārasampāto?","ne26:2.1":"“Tasmā rakkhitacittassa, sammāsaṅkappagocaro”ti gāthā.","ne26:2.2":"“Tasmā rakkhitacittassa, sammāsaṅkappagocaro”ti samatho [ayaṃ samatho (sī. ka.)].","ne26:2.3":"“Sammādiṭṭhipurekkhāro”ti vipassanā.","ne26:2.4":"“Ñatvāna udayabbayan”ti dukkhapariññā.","ne26:2.5":"“Thinamiddhābhibhū bhikkhū”ti samudayapahānaṃ.","ne26:2.6":"“Sabbā duggatiyo jahe”ti nirodho [ayaṃ nirodho (sī. ka.)].","ne26:2.7":"Imāni cattāri saccāni.","ne26:2.8":"Niyutto āvaṭṭo hārasampāto."},"attha":{"book":"Nett-a","bookName":"Nettippakaraṇa-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0519a.att","from":687,"to":687,"paras":[{"para":687,"vripara":"69","refs":["ne26:2"],"lines":["Nekkhammasaṅkappabahulo kasiṇavasena mettādivasena vā laddhāya cittekaggatāsaṅkhātāya cittamañjūsāya cittaṃ ṭhapetvā samādhiṃyeva vā yathāladdhaṃ saṃkilesato rakkhitacitto nāma hotīti vuttaṃ –","<b>“tasmā rakkhitacittassa sammāsaṅkappagocaroti ayaṃ samatho”</b>ti.","Paññāpadhānā vipassanāti āha –","<b>“sammādiṭṭhipurekkhāroti ayaṃ vipassanā”</b>ti.","Ariyamaggena dukkhasacce pariññāte udayabbayadassanaṃ matthakappattaṃ nāma hotīti vuttaṃ –","<b>“ñatvāna udayabbayanti dukkhapariññā”</b>ti.","“Yaṃ kiñci samudayadhammaṃ, sabbaṃ taṃ nirodhadhamman”ti hi maggañāṇassa pavattidassanāti.","<b>Imāni cattāri saccānī</b>ti catusaccadhammavasena āvaṭṭanaṃ niṭṭhapeti.","Tattha purimena saccadvayaṭṭhapanena visabhāgadhammavasena, pacchimena sabhāgadhammavasena āvaṭṭananti daṭṭhabbaṃ."],"lineRefs":[["ne26:2"],["ne26:2"],["ne26:2"],["ne26:2"],["ne26:2"],["ne26:2"],["ne26:2"],["ne26:2"],["ne26:2"]]}],"wordLinks":[["ne26:2.4","ñatvāna udayabbayanti dukkhapariññā",0,5],["ne26:2.7","imāni cattāri saccānī",0,7]]},"tika":null}
